BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 639 Td
(x^\(k\) in V^81,    h^\(k\) in R^\(81 x 384\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 623 Td
(At clue positions, x^\(0\) contains the given digit; at empty positions it contains [MASK].) Tj
0 -14 Td
(Initialize h^\(0\) = 0. Let c_i = 1 denote an immutable clue position.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 14 Tf
58 592 Td
(2. RELAY Forward Pass) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 563 Td
(At iteration k, RELAY combines token embeddings with the relayed hidden state:) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 546 Td
(u^\(k\) = Embed_theta\(x^\(k\)\) + LN_relay\(h^\(k\)\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 530 Td
(z^\(k\) = Transformer_theta\(u^\(k\)\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 514 Td
(The same forward pass produces token logits and the Gaussian hidden-policy mean:) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 497 Td
(Lambda^\(k\) = LMHead_theta\(LN_out\(z^\(k\)\)\),) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 481 Td
(mu^\(k\) = z^\(k\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 465 Td
(Lambda^\(k\) defines token probabilities; mu^\(k\) defines the mean of the hidden Gaussian) Tj
0 -14 Td
(policy.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 14 Tf
58 434 Td
(3. Token Probabilities) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 405 Td
(Full-vocabulary token probabilities use token temperature tau_tok > 0:) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 388 Td
(P_[i,v]^\(k\) = exp\(Lambda_[i,v]^\(k\) / tau_tok\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 372 Td
(              / sum_u exp\(Lambda_[i,u]^\(k\) / tau_tok\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 356 Td
(For every selected position i, sample) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 339 Td
(xhat_i^\(k\) ~ Categorical\(P_[i,:]^\(k\)\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 323 Td
(An equivalent Gumbel-Max implementation is) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 306 Td
(xhat_i^\(k\) = argmax_v [Lambda_[i,v]^\(k\) / tau_tok + g_[i,v]],) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 290 Td
(g_[i,v] ~ Gumbel\(0, 1\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 14 Tf
58 274 Td
(4. Confidence-Based Position Selection) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 245 Td
(The currently masked and mutable positions are) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 228 Td
(M^\(k\) = {i : x_i^\(k\) = [MASK] and c_i = 0}.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 212 Td
(Confidence uses a separate temperature T_conf:) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 195 Td
(P_conf_[i,v]^\(k\) = softmax\(Lambda_[i,:]^\(k\) / T_conf\)_v,) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 179 Td
(a_i^\(k\) = max_v P_conf_[i,v]^\(k\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 163 Td
(Sort the mutable masked positions by decreasing confidence:) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 146 Td
(a_pi1^\(k\) >= a_pi2^\(k\) >= ... >= a_pin^\(k\),    n = |M^\(k\)|.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 130 Td
(Define cumulative uncertainty and the initial selected set:) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 113 Td
(C_j^\(k\) = sum_\(r=1\)^j \(1 - a_pir^\(k\)\),) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 97 Td
(U_tilde^\(k\) = {pi_j : C_j^\(k\) < eta}.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 81 Td
(The final selected set is) Tj
