(q_theta\(h^\(k+1\) | s_k\) = Normal\(h^\(k+1\); mu^\(k\), sigma^2 I\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 530 Td
(Sample independent Gaussian noise and update the relayed hidden state:) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 513 Td
(epsilon^\(k\) ~ Normal\(0, I\),) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 497 Td
(h^\(k+1\) = mu^\(k\) + sigma epsilon^\(k\)) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 8.7 Tf
70 481 Td
(          = z^\(k\)  + sigma epsilon^\(k\).) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9.5 Tf
58 465 Td
